#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:64
msgid "Lafka — Analytics"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:65
msgid "Multi-platform tracking via Google Tag Manager (orchestrator) plus direct platform fallbacks for GA4, Microsoft Clarity, and Meta Pixel. Consent Mode v2 defaults emit BEFORE any tag fires so the site is CPPA/GDPR-compliant out of the box. Paste your IDs once here — the plugin handles emit order, escaping, and consent gating."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:296
msgid "Tag manager"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:297
msgid "Google Tag Manager is the recommended orchestrator. Once GTM is set, you wire GA4 / Clarity / Meta Pixel inside the GTM UI and the plugin emits a single container snippet. The direct-platform fields below are only used when this field is empty (operator can pick the simpler path during early setup)."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:315
msgid "GTM Container ID"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:316
msgid "Format: GTM-XXXXXXX. Find it at tagmanager.google.com → your container → top-right. When set, the plugin emits the GTM head snippet + body noscript iframe per Google's install spec. Leave blank to use direct-platform IDs below."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:334
msgid "Direct platform IDs (used only if GTM is empty)"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:335
msgid "Override-not-additive: if any GTM Container ID is set above, the plugin emits ONLY the GTM snippet and lets you wire these platforms via GTM tags (avoids double-firing). GA4 has a hard cap of 500 distinct event names per property — Microsoft Clarity is unlimited and complements GA4 for heatmaps + session replay. Meta Pixel is required only if you run paid Facebook/Instagram ads. GSC verification turns on the data feed for Google Search Console (rank tracking + click metrics)."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:353
msgid "GA4 Measurement ID"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:354
msgid "Format: G-XXXXXXXXXX. Find it at analytics.google.com → Admin → Data Streams → Web → Measurement ID. Only used when GTM is empty."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:375
msgid "Microsoft Clarity Project ID"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:376
msgid "Alphanumeric project ID from clarity.microsoft.com. Free, unlimited heatmaps + session replay — complements GA4. Only used when GTM is empty."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:394
msgid "Cloudflare Web Analytics token"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:395
msgid "32-character token from the Cloudflare dashboard → Analytics & Logs → Web Analytics → your site → \"JS snippet\" (the data-cf-beacon token). Cookieless + privacy-first, so it emits independently of GTM and consent."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:416
msgid "Meta Pixel ID"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:417
msgid "15-16 digit numeric ID from business.facebook.com → Events Manager → Data Sources. Only needed when running paid Facebook / Instagram ads. Only used when GTM is empty."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:435
msgid "TikTok Pixel ID"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:436
msgid "TikTok Ads Manager → Assets → Events → Web events → your pixel (the ID in capitals, e.g. C1ABCD2EFGHIJK3LMN4O). Only needed when running TikTok ads. Only used when GTM is empty."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:454
msgid "Meta Conversions API access token"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:455
msgid "Events Manager → your Pixel → Settings → Conversions API → Generate access token. With it, every paid order is also sent from the server (deduplicated with the Pixel), so ad blockers and payment redirects no longer hide sales. Needs ad consent. Left alone when the official Meta for WooCommerce plugin is active."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:473
msgid "GA4 Measurement Protocol API secret"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:474
msgid "GA4 Admin → Data streams → your web stream → Measurement Protocol API secrets → Create. With it, a paid order whose thank-you page never loaded (closed tab, payment redirect) is still recorded in GA4. Needs analytics consent."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:492
msgid "Google Ads conversion ID"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:493
msgid "Format: AW-123456789. Google Ads → Goals → Conversions → your purchase action → Tag setup. Only used when GTM is empty."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:514
msgid "Google Ads purchase conversion label"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:515
msgid "The label after the slash in send_to (AW-123456789/AbC-dEfGhIj). Each order sends one conversion with its value and order number; with ad_user_data consent the order email and phone go along as enhanced conversion data (hashed by Google's tag before sending)."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:533
msgid "Google Search Console verification token"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:534
msgid "Paste only the content=\"...\" value from the HTML verification snippet Google gave you (not the full meta tag). Required once to claim the property in search.google.com/search-console — after verification you can leave it set or remove it."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:549
msgid "Consent + privacy"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:550
msgid "Google Consent Mode v2 defaults emit BEFORE any tag fires so the site is compliant from the first byte. The banner appears at the bottom of the viewport until the visitor Accepts, Rejects, or sets per-category preferences. Defaults are denied (most-restrictive) — set to granted only if your legal review allows opt-out-rather-than-opt-in (some EU jurisdictions do not)."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:568
msgid "Show consent banner"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:569
msgid "When ON, the banner appears for every new visitor until they decide. When OFF, the plugin still emits the Consent Mode v2 default state (still safer than no consent at all) but never asks for an explicit decision."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:576
msgid "Denied (most-restrictive default)"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:577
msgid "Granted (opt-out flow — check your jurisdiction first)"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:582
msgid "Default state: analytics_storage"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:583
msgid "GA4 / Clarity / behavioural-analytics storage. Required for any usage metric. Defaults to denied (Consent Mode v2 baseline)."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:586
msgid "Default state: ad_storage"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:587
msgid "Cookies/identifiers used for advertising (Meta Pixel, Google Ads). Defaults to denied."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:590
msgid "Default state: ad_user_data"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:591
msgid "Sending user data to Google for advertising. Required for Enhanced Conversions. Defaults to denied."
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:594
msgid "Default state: ad_personalization"
msgstr ""

#: incl/customizer/class-lafka-customizer-analytics.php:595
msgid "Personalised ads / remarketing audiences. Defaults to denied."
msgstr ""

